    "description": "What: AQ102 S1 (CE-2355) - on open basic-desert, 'Blue' (Friend grenadier, TKB 2004) behind 'Blue Car 2' at (277,360) and 'Red' (Hostile grenadier) behind 'Red Car 2' at (283,400), ~43 m apart; three parked cars each side, nothing else. No orders: each runs his type's default SOP (all immortal, so the fight lasts). Judge (90 s): (1) neither stays hidden doing nothing (no move > 1 m, no shot) for more than 12 s while the other is alive; (2) each fires from at least two distinct spots, never the same spot twice running; (3) at least one flank or firing-position move (a car he did not start behind); (4) a grenade over cover once they are within 25 m. Check: python3 scripts/utility-demo-check.py --launch rf-car-duel. \ud83d\udcc4 docs/blueprints/Architect_Question_102_Responsive_Fighting_Reflexes.md \u00a75"
